00049:       "line": 113,
00050:       "text": "- 结果：常规 = 1（胜）；训练家战斗且可战斗成员为 0 → 0（未决）；写入基准备份变量并返回结果。",
00051:       "meaning": "The explicit result split is already correct and must remain; this proposal is only the introductory parenthesis."
00052:     },
