00077:     "observable_boundary": "The helper passes different result values to pbSet and returns different values. No host game variable/display execution is claimed.",
00078:     "failure_partial_commit": "Both variants may already display/clear rules/reset next-battle fields before pbSet; later exception is not rollback. Exact receiver execution remains NOT_EXECUTED.",
00079:     "why_finite": "This is an overbroad parenthetical summary contradicted by its correct explicit result row. No missing skip algorithm, no wrong main outcome row, no reopening C0014 semantic no-battle definition.",
00080:     "suggested_minimal_change": "Replace only the parenthesis with wording that acknowledges message and result branches, or remove it. Preserve current line113 and all concrete skip writes.",
